enter; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Neville Barnes", "motive": "Neville wants the park closed at dusk to stop the noisy bootcamp, and the council said more reports of people feeling unsafe could make that happen (clues 5 and 6).", "proof": ["The costume was hired by ‘N. B.’ with phone number 07700 900812 (clue 4).", "That is Neville Barnes's number on the petition leaflet (clue 5).", "The Phantom always runs off towards Elm Row, where Neville lives (clues 1 and 5).", "So his claim that he never hired a costume is a lie (clue 6)."], "cleared": ["<b>Hugo</b> was serving at the west gate kiosk at 19:43–19:46 each time (clue 2).", "<b>Carla and Fiona</b> were at the bootcamp on the east lawn (clue 3).", "<b>Ray</b> was on the till in his shop until 20:00 (clue 4).", "<b>Tessa</b> is one of the people who was scared (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "the-midnight-hack", "level": 2, "crime": "Hacking", "who": "hacker", "title": "The Midnight Hack", "teaser": "A start-up's secret app code is copied from the CEO's account late at night. The log points at the junior developer – or does it?", "intro": "At Brightloop, a small app company in Copenhagen, someone logged into CEO <b>Nadia Berg</b>'s account one November night and copied the code for the new app to a USB stick. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Brightloop, a small app company in Copenhagen, someone logged into CEO Nadia Berg's account one November night and copied the code for the new app to a USB stick. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Felix Moreau", "role": "Junior developer"}, {"name": "Ingrid Holm", "role": "Office manager"}, {"name": "Lara Quint", "role": "Cleaner"}, {"name": "Marcus Vale", "role": "Founder of rival Nimbus Apps"}, {"name": "Nadia Berg", "role": "CEO"}, {"name": "Toby Shaw", "role": "IT admin"}], "clues": [{"name": "Nadia Berg", "role": "CEO", "quote": "I left the office at half past five and spent the evening at a dinner party across town. Somebody used my account – I have never even sat at PC-07.", "label": "IT INCIDENT REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">IT incident report – Thursday night</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Account used</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">n.berg (CEO)</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Login</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\"><b>22:47 UTC</b> from PC-07 (2nd floor, window desk)</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Files copied</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">brightloop-app-v2 → USB stick, 22:51 UTC</div></div><div styl