her says she was helping Hugo in the firing zone, but Hugo fires alone and no one else entered the zone (clue 5).", "At 21:40 Rupert's gloves lay on the coat table; at 21:48 they were gone, as the farm manager put on her coat by the door (clue 4). One glove was left by the body to frame Rupert (clue 1).", "So her alibi is false, and she is the only one with no witness at 22:00 (clues 1, 3, 4 and 5)."], "cleared": ["Rupert inherits the farm (clue 2) and lied about being in the barn, but the car park camera shows him with Camille from 21:53 to 22:16 (clue 3).", "Camille (offer refused) lied about leaving early, but the camera clears her too (clue 3).", "Hugo was alone in the firing zone (clue 5). Wilf was on stage and Tamsin at the bar (clues 1 and 4)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-recording-studio", "level": 1, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Recording Studio", "teaser": "A music producer is found dead in Studio B. His recorder was still running – and it caught the last argument of his life.", "intro": "At Echo Lane Studios, producer <b>Max Delacourt</b> was found dead in Studio B, struck on the head with a heavy microphone stand. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Echo Lane Studios, producer Max Delacourt was found dead in Studio B, struck on the head with a heavy microphone stand. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": "2026-12-04", "public": "2026-12-04", "suspects": [{"name": "Devan Rhodes", "role": "Sound engineer"}, {"name": "Hilda Brook", "role": "Night cleaner"}, {"name": "Kit Morrow", "role": "Drummer, The Lanterns"}, {"name": "Lorna Fitch", "role": "Band manager"}, {"name": "Rory Blaze", "role": "Guitarist, The Lanterns"}, {"name": "Selma Quinn", "role": "Singer, The Lanterns"}], "clues": [{"name": "Hilda Brook", "role": "Night cleaner", "quote": "I let myself in at twenty-five past elev