h break. Without a kite she missed the final. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Breezy Point Kite Festival, someone cut the line of Red Dragon, Tilda Marsh's champion stunt kite, during the lunch break. Without a kite she missed the final. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": "2026-12-07", "public": "2026-12-07", "suspects": [{"name": "Barnaby Fitch", "role": "Finalist"}, {"name": "Grace Oduya", "role": "Head judge"}, {"name": "Kenji Abbott", "role": "Ice cream seller"}, {"name": "Rosa Quill", "role": "Face painter"}, {"name": "Tilda Marsh", "role": "Owner of Red Dragon"}, {"name": "Wes Harlow", "role": "Finalist"}], "clues": [{"name": "Tilda Marsh", "role": "Owner of Red Dragon", "quote": "I pegged Red Dragon out on Pitch 1 at half past twelve and went to the café with my grandad. When I came back, the line had been cut and my kite was a dot over the sea.", "label": "STEWARD'S REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Steward's report – Pitch 1</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">12:30</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Red Dragon pegged out by Tilda</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">13:00</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B1