ine with orange scissors (clue 6). Wes wears a green cap (clue 2)."], "cleared": ["<b>Barnaby</b> and <b>Grace</b> were together in the judges' tent from 12:25 to 13:05 (clue 4).", "<b>Tilda</b> was eating an ice cream by the van at 12:50 (clue 6), and it was her own kite that was ruined.", "<b>Rosa</b> and <b>Kenji</b> were busy at their stalls (clue 6), and neither had a wristband to get in (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "the-escape-room-robbery", "level": 2, "crime": "Theft", "who": "thief", "title": "The Escape Room Robbery", "teaser": "The week's takings vanish from the office of Lock & Riddle. The game master swears he saw the thief slip out of the Tomb room at 42:00.", "intro": "At <b>Lock &amp; Riddle Escape Rooms</b>, £2,400 in takings disappeared from the office safe on Friday evening while groups were playing. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Lock & Riddle Escape Rooms, £2,400 in takings disappeared from the office safe on Friday evening while groups were playing. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": "2026-12-08", "public": "2026-12-08", "suspects": [{"name": "Ade Okafor", "role": "Locksmith"}, {"name": "Boris Klein", "role": "Fiona's teammate"}, {"name": "Fiona Marsh", "role": "Former staff, playing tonight"}, {"name": "Imelda Voss", "role": "Owner"}, {"name": "Kat Duffy", "role": "Receptionist"}, {"name": "Lenny Shaw", "role": "Game master"}], "clues": [{"name": "Imelda Voss", "role": "Owner", "quote": "I counted the takings into the safe just before seven. At ten past eight the safe was open and empty. Whoever did it knew the staff code.", "label": "OWNER'S REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Owner's report – Friday</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">18:55</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">£2,400 counted into the office safe</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">19:42</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Office keypad opened with the <b>staff code</b></div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">20:10</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Safe found open and empty</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Who knows the code</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Imelda, Lenny, Kat – and Fiona, who worked here until last month. The code was never changed</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"f