\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Board 2: Edgar's chair is empty. Tobias at board 1, Rosalind at the arbiters' table, Leopold on the balcony.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-at-the-chess-congress/cam-2|CAM_2}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">15:30</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">The steward's chair by the side door is empty. Edgar's chair still empty. Tobias, Rosalind and Leopold where they were.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-at-the-chess-congress/cam-3|CAM_3}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">15:38</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Edgar back at board 2. Dolly comes in the main door with a cake box.</div>\n</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"d