/tr></table></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 109 · LEVEL 3 · BURGLARY</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE TIDAL<br>ISLAND BELL</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\"><b>Brannoc Isle</b> is joined to the village of Saltmere by a causeway that is only safe around low tide. On Friday night the island's silver chapel bell, 600 years old, was stolen. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-tidal-island-bell/cressida-vane}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Cressida Vane</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Lives on Quay Row</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”My doorbell camera looks over Quay Row, the quay and the B&B. I'm a light sleeper but I never set foot outside – my door only opened at nine, for the milk.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · CRESSIDA VANE</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · DOORBELL CAMERA</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Doorbell camera · 5 Quay Row</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%\"><tr><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Time</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Seen</th></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Fri 23:50</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">The Anchor's karaoke night ends. Lots of singing</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sat 00:38</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Ruth Penrose walks up and goes into the B&B (its only door is in view)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sat 03:20</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">A yellow camper van drives off along the quay</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sat 04:41</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">The yellow camper van comes back. Wheels caked in wet sand</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sat 06:02</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Ruth Penrose comes out of the B&B and hurries towards the causeway</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sat 09:00</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Cressida opens her door for the milk</td></tr></table></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Jago Treloar", "motive": "Jago's business was struggling (clue 3), and he knew the bell's value better than anyone – he had restored it.", "proof": ["The bell was taken at 03:52 (clue 1). The causeway was safe again from 03:05 on Saturday (clue 5) – so Jago's claim that nobody could cross until morning is false, and the thief could have come from Saltmere.", "At 03:20 a yellow camper van left Quay Row, and it came back at 04:41 with its wheels caked in wet sand (clue 6) – the sand also found on the chapel floor (clue 1).", "Jago lives at 2 Quay Row and drives the yellow camper van (clue 3). So he was not at home all night."], "cleared": ["<b>Felix</b> wanted the bell (clue 2), but he, the Lowes and <b>Morwenna</b> were inside the guesthouse, and no door or window opened from 23:15 to 06:40 (clue 4).", "<b>Ruth</b> lied: she wasn't in her cottage but stuck in the mainland B&B after karaoke, from 00:38 to 06:02 (clue 6).", "<b>Davey</b> was on lifeboat duty all night (clue 5), and <b>Cressida</b>'s door stayed shut until 09:00 (clue 6)."]}}, {"slug": "the-chocolate-formula", "level": 3, "crime": "Espionage", "who": "spy", "title": "The Chocolate Formula", "teaser": "A secret chocolate recipe is photographed in a locked vault and sold to a rival. Four people know the code – and three have alibis.", "intro": "At <b>Velvetine Chocolate Works</b>, someone photographed the secret formula for ‘Midnight Velvet’ in the recipe vault. A month later a rival launched the very same bar. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Velvetine Chocolate Works, someone photographed the secret formula for ‘Midnight Velvet’ in the recipe vault. A month later a rival launched the very same bar. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-15", "suspects": [{"name": "Gwen Hollis", "role": "Receptionist"}, {"name": "Jonah Moss", "role": "Packer"}, {"name": "Lucien Faure", "role": "Head chocolatier"}, {"name": "Marcus Kerr", "role": "Production supervisor"}, {"name": "Octavia Bloom", "role": "Owner and CEO"}, {"name": "Pippa Strand", "role": "Quality manager"}], "clues": [{"name": "Octavia Bloom", "role": "Owner and CEO", "quote": "The rival's bar is our recipe to the gram. Their spy slipped up: the photo shows our vault clock and calendar. I was in the board meeting all that afternoon, with the bank on video.", "label": "CEO'S REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Report – the leaked photo</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">The photo</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">The formula card on the vault table. Wall clock: 14:25. Desk calendar: Tuesday 3 March</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault door</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Sensor log, 3 March: opened 14:22, closed 14:29</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault code</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Known only to O. Bloom, L. Faure, P. Strand and M. Kerr</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">In the Old Mill building</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">O. Bloom</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Board meeting 14:00–15:00, Old Mill boardroom (minutes, video recording)</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 110 · LEVEL 3 · ESPIONAGE</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE CHOCOLATE<br>FORMULA</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At <b>Velvetine Chocolate Works</b>, someone photographed the secret formula for ‘Midnight Velvet’ in the recipe vault. A month later a rival launched the very same bar. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-chocolate-formula/octavia-bloom}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Octavia Bloom</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Owner and CEO</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”The rival's bar is our recipe to the gram. Their spy slipped up: the photo shows our vault clock and calendar. I was in the board meeting all that afternoon, with the bank on video.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · OCTAVIA BLOOM</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #1 · CEO'S REPORT</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Report – the leaked photo</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">The photo</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">The formula card on the vault table. Wall clock: 14:25. Desk calendar: Tuesday 3 March</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault door</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Sensor log, 3 March: opened 14:22, closed 14:29</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault code</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Known only to O. Bloom, L. Faure, P. Strand and M. Kerr</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Vault</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">In the Old Mill building</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">O. Bloom</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Board meeting 14:00–15:00, Old Mill boardroom (minutes, video recording)</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Lucien Faure", "role": "Head chocolatier", "quote": "Yes, the rival wants me. Who wouldn't? But Midnight Velvet is my own creation. That afternoon I was in the kitchen with a TV crew, making truffles for the cameras.", "label": "EMAIL IN LUCIEN'S INBOX", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">EMAIL – FROM COCOA ROYALE, 20 FEB</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Dear Lucien,</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">our offer stands: head of chocolate, double your pay.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">And do bring your ideas with you –</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">we'd love to taste them.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– The Directors, Cocoa Royale</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 110 · LEVEL 3 · ESPIONAGE</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE CHOCOLATE<br>FORMULA</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">2</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At <b>Velvetine Chocolate Works</b>, someone photographed the secret formula for ‘Midnight Velvet’ in the recipe vault. A month later a rival launched the very same bar. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-chocolate-formula/lucien-faure}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Lucien Faure</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Head chocolatier</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”Yes, the rival wants me. Who wouldn't? But Midnight Velvet is my own creation. That afternoon I was in the kitchen with a TV crew, making truffles for the cameras.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · LUCIEN FAURE</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #2 · EMAIL IN LUCIEN'S INBOX</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">EMAIL – FROM COCOA ROYALE, 20 FEB</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Dear Lucien,</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">our offer stands: head of chocolate, double your pay.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">And do bring your ideas with you –</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">we'd love to taste them.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– The Directors, Cocoa Royale</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, 