x; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Irina Sokol", "motive": "Irina is Lena's mother (clues 3 and 4: the same surname and the ‘Mama’ card). She wanted her daughter to dance the lead on opening night.", "proof": ["The tea was poisoned when dressing room 1 was opened at 20:22 (clue 1).", "Irina says she was doing the Cygnets' quick change at twenty past eight, ‘like every night’ (clue 4). On a normal night that is right – but the quick change comes 50 minutes after curtain up (clue 5).", "Tonight the curtain went up late, at 19:42 (clue 6). So the quick change was at 20:32, not 20:20 – and at 20:22 Irina was free to go upstairs."], "cleared": ["<b>Lena</b> gained the most, but she was having her ankle strapped in the basement from 20:10 to 20:30 (clue 3).", "<b>Polly</b> lied about never leaving – she popped out for chips from 20:17 to 20:29 (clue 6).", "<b>Owen</b> called cues at 20:22 and 20:23 from beside the stage (clues 5 and 6), <b>Bernie</b> signed for flowers at his door at 20:22 (clue 6) and <b>Tatiana</b> was on stage all through Act 2 (clue 5)."]}}, {"slug": "the-rose-show-vandal", "level": 3, "crime": "Vandalism", "who": "vandal", "title": "The Rose Show Vandal", "teaser": "The night before judging, every bloom on the favourite rose bushes is snipped off. The chief suspect has a perfect answer: it's half an hour away.", "intro": "At the <b>Thornbury Park Rose Show</b>, someone cut the heads off all 24 blooms of Edith Paget's ‘Crimson Duchess’ roses the night before judging. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Thornbury Park Rose Show, someone cut the heads off all 24 blooms of Edith Paget's ‘Crimson Duchess’ roses the night before judging. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-15", "suspects": [{"name": "Agatha Bramble", "role": "Last year's runner-up"}, {"name": "Dr Rupert Wynn", "role": "Head judge"}, {"name": "Edith Paget", "role": "Grower of Crimson Duchess"}, {"name": "Hugh Paget", "role": "Edith's husband"}, {"name": "Neville Ash", "role": "Rival rose grower"}, {"name": "Stan Hobbs", "role": "Night watchman"}], "clues": [{"name": "Edith Paget", "role": "Grower of Crimson Duchess", "quote": "Twenty-four perfect blooms, three years' work. I was at the Rose Society dinner in the Orangery until half past eleven. Whoever did this knew exactly which plot was mine.", "label": "EDITH'S REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Report – show garden, plot 7</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">22:40</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Night watchman's round: the roses are whole</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Lodge camera</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">S. Hobbs inside the gate lodge, 22:44–23:16. The lodge is 3 minutes from plot 7</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">23:20</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Next round: all 24 heads cut off with secateurs</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">On the ground</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">A trail of red petals along the river path, towards Upton</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Orangery</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">In the park, 5 minutes from plot 7</div>