leven, then walked home the long way by the river. The park's half an hour away by the road, so how could I?", "label": "FOX INN RECEIPT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"width: 340px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.55; transform: rotate(-1.5deg)\"><div style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px\">THE FOX INN</div><div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px\">High Street, Upton</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\"></div><div>1 pint of cider</div><div>1 bag of pork scratchings</div><div>Card: N. ASH</div><div>Time: 22:45</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\">Darts every Friday!</div></div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 115 · LEVEL 3 · VANDALISM</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE ROSE<br>SHOW VANDAL</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the <b>Thornbury Park Rose Show</b>, someone cut the heads off all 24 blooms of Edith Paget's ‘Crimson Duchess’ roses the night before judging. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-rose-show-vandal/neville-ash}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Neville Ash</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Rival rose grower</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”Edith and I don't get on, that's no secret. I was at the Fox in Upton until quarter to eleven, then walked home the long way by the river. The park's half an hour away by the road, so how could I?”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · NEVILLE ASH</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · FOX INN RECEIPT</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"width: 340px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.55; transform: rotate(-1.5deg)\"><div style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px\">THE FOX INN</div><div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px\">High Street, Upton</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\"></div><div>1 pint of cider</div><div>1 bag of pork scratchings</div><div>Card: N. ASH</div><div>Time: 22:45</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\">Darts every Friday!</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Neville Ash", "motive": "Neville is a rival grower – third last year (clue 3) – and he and Edith don't get on.", "proof": ["The roses were cut between 22:40 and 23:20, and the petal trail leads along the river path towards Upton (clue 1).", "Neville left the Fox in Upton at 22:45 (clue 6) and has nobody to say where he was after that. His only defence is that the park is half an hour away by the road.", "But the new footbridge, open since Monday, gets you from Upton to the park in 8 minutes (clue 5). He had time to cross, cut the roses and walk home ‘the long way by the river’."], "cleared": ["<b>Agatha</b> had secateurs and a motive, but she gave her talk from 22:30 to 23:28 (clue 2).", "<b>Hugh</b> lied – he was at the pub, not at home – but he paid at the Fox at 22:50, 23:05 and 23:18 (clue 4). Even by the footbridge, that leaves no time to get to the park and back.", "<b>Edith</b> and <b>Dr Wynn</b> were at the top table (clue 2), and <b>Stan</b> was in the lodge from 22:44 to 23:16 (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-model-railway-show", "level": 3, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Model Railway Show", "teaser": "The show's organiser is killed upstairs at 14:28. One exhibitor's log proves he ran a train every twenty minutes. Check the clock.", "intro": "At the <b>Drayford Model Railway Show</b> in the old Corn Exchange, organiser <b>Barnaby Thorpe</b> was found dead in the committee room upstairs on Saturday afternoon. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Drayford Model Railway Show in the old Corn Exchange, organiser Barnaby Thorpe was found dead in the committee