: -6px\">Co-judge</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I judged Ewan's run alone while Hamish had his tea. I took a photo from the judges' box to send to the newspaper.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · SHONA GRANT</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #2 · JUDGES' BOX PHOTO</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Shona's phone</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-at-the-sheepdog-trials/img-0412|IMG_0412}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">14:12</div>\n<div style=\"font-family