: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I fenced whoever was in Clara's jacket – with the mask down, you can't see a face. But she fenced left-handed tonight, which she never does. I lost 15–11.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · JO MOSS</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #2 · SCORING MACHINE</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Piste 2 – electronic scoring</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%\"><tr><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Start</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">End</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Fencer A (jacket)</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Fencer B (jacket)</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, sys