ight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Roger Pinn", "motive": "Roger had come second to Bella two years running and wanted the trophy and £75 (clues 1 and 5).", "proof": ["Fred was wrecked overnight, and narrow bicycle tracks were left in the mud (clue 1).", "Roger says he has no bicycle, but on Monday he brought in a narrow-tyred racing bike with mud and straw in the gears (clue 3).", "At 01:10 Pip saw a man on a thin racing bike in a 'Space Scarecrow' T-shirt riding towards Mill Row (clue 2) – Roger's scarecrow and Roger's street (clue 6)."], "cleared": ["<b>Bella</b> was in the pub until closing (clue 4).", "<b>Jenny</b> was serving at The Plough and rides a wide-tyred mountain bike (clues 3 and 4).", "<b>Hal</b>, <b>Pip</b> and <b>Mr Shaw</b> only report what they know."]}}, {"slug": "the-cycle-race-sabotage", "level": 2, "crime": "Sabotage", "who": "saboteur", "title": "The Cycle Race Sabotage", "teaser": "The race favourite's brake cable snaps on the first descent. Someone cut it in the team tent – and one rival's alibi is a little too well timed.", "intro": "At the <b>Dales Classic</b> amateur cycle race, favourite Tessa Hart crashed on the first descent when her front brake cable snapped. The mechanic found it had been cut almost through. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Dales Classic amateur cycle race, favourite Tessa Hart crashed on the first descent when her front brake cable snapped. The mechanic found it had been cut almost through. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Gus Ward", "role": "Sign-on marshal"}, {"name": "Mia Lund", "role": "Rival cyclist"}, {"name": "Olly Price", "role": "Photographer"}, {"name": "Ray Kaye", "role": "Team mechanic"}, {"name": "Sara Lund", "role": "Mia's sister"}, {"name": "Tessa Hart", "role": "Cyclist"}], "clues": [{"name": "Tessa Hart", "role": "Cyclist", "quote": "My bike was checked at eight and then left in the team tent while I warmed up on the rollers outside. I started at nine and crashed at twenty past.", "label": "RACE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Race report</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Bike checked</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">08:00 by the team mechanic – brakes perfect</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">In the tent alone</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">08:05