, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "In the hills above Alba, truffle dealer Marco Bellini was found dead in the Bosco Nero oak wood during a guided truffle hunt for wealthy guests. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Anna Ricci", "role": "Truffle hunter"}, {"name": "Elena Bassi", "role": "Hunt organiser"}, {"name": "Giulia Neri", "role": "Truffle hunter"}, {"name": "Ispettore Lucia Ferri", "role": "Police"}, {"name": "Mr James Holt", "role": "Guest"}, {"name": "Paolo Conti", "role": "Truffle hunter"}], "clues": [{"name": "Ispettore Lucia Ferri", "role": "Police", "quote": "Signor Bellini was struck with a truffle spade near the old well. His phone shows he was sending a message at 10:31, so he died after that. He was found at 11:00.", "label": "POLICE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Police report – Bosco Nero</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">11:00, by the old well</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Last message sent</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">10:31, from his phone</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; pa