m Van Takings", "teaser": "A whole bank-holiday's takings vanish from an ice-cream van on the seafront. The van's chime, a sticky receipt and the tide timetable tell the real story.", "intro": "On <b>Saltby seafront</b>, ice-cream seller Gino Russo's bank-holiday takings – £1,840 in a cash bag – disappeared from his van while he was helping at a rescue on the beach. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "On Saltby seafront, ice-cream seller Gino Russo's bank-holiday takings – £1,840 in a cash bag – disappeared from his van while he was helping at a rescue on the beach. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Eli Watts", "role": "Harbour master"}, {"name": "Gino Russo", "role": "Ice-cream seller"}, {"name": "Kelly Moss", "role": "Gino's assistant"}, {"name": "Marco Russo", "role": "Gino's cousin"}, {"name": "Paul Grant", "role": "Deckchair attendant"}, {"name": "Rita Dunn", "role": "Fish-and-chip shop owner"}], "clues": [{"name": "Gino Russo", "role": "Ice-cream seller", "quote": "At four o'clock a child got stuck on the groyne and I ran down to help. I left the van unlocked – stupid. When I came back at twenty past, the cash bag under the counter was gone.", "label": "THEFT REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Theft report</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Van left</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">16:00</div></div><div style=\"display: