 IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Donna Shaw", "motive": "Raymond was signing a sale that day that would fill in the pool and end every staff contract, including Donna's (clue 4).", "proof": ["Raymond died at 06:12 (clue 1). Only Raymond (05:55) and Donna (06:02) had come in through the turnstile before then (clue 3).", "Donna says she stayed in the plant room after starting her work. But the chlorine dosing ran automatically, and the camera shows her leaving the plant room at 06:09 towards the pool and coming back at 06:16 soaked from the chest down (clues 2 and 5)."], "cleared": ["<b>Gary</b> only came in at 06:30 and signed for café deliveries at 06:31 and 06:33 (clues 3 and 6).", "<b>Sam</b> arrived at 06:40 (clue 3), <b>Theo</b> only reached the café at 06:31 (clue 6), and <b>Nora</b> was not at the lido at all – no card of hers is on the turnstile log (clue 3)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-climbing-wall", "level": 3, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Climbing Wall", "teaser": "A climbing-gym owner falls from the top wall after closing. The rope was cut, the gym was locked – and the auto-belay log knows who was still climbing.", "intro": "At <b>Summit Climbing Centre</b>, owner Will Hartley was found dead at the foot of the 15-metre lead wall after the gym had closed for the night. His rope had been cut almost through. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Summit Climbing Centre, owner Will Hartley was found dead at the foot of the 15-metre lead wall after the gym had closed for the night. His rope had been cut almost through. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Ana Silva", "role": "Cleaner"}, {"name": "DI Mark Osei", "role": "Police"}, {"name": "Josh Hartley", "role": "Will's brother, co-owner"}, {"name": "Kira Brand", "role": "Route setter"}, {"name": "Leo Marsh", "role": "Bookkeeper"}, {"name": "Sophie Hartley", "role": "Will's wife"}], "clues": [{"name": "DI Mark Osei", "role": "Police", "quote": "Mr Hartley fell when his rope snapped – it had been cut with a blade to a few strands. Someone did it while he was climbing, from the top platform.", "label": "POLICE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Police report – Summit Climbing Centre</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">22:40, foot of the lead wall</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Fall</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">22:12 – recorded by the wall's impact sensor</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Rope</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Cut almost through, about 2 m below the top anchor</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: