%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Barney Hale", "motive": "Barney complained that he never gets a chocolate egg himself (clue 6).", "proof": ["The egg went between 18:00 and 19:30, leaving white fake fur on the floor (clue 1).", "Barney says he sang through evensong, but he left at 18:35 and came back at 19:15 (clue 3).", "At 18:45 Ken saw someone in a white bunny suit carry a box towards the church hall (clue 5). The bunny costume – made to fit Barney – was damp with chocolate on the paws (clue 4), and only Barney and Gemma have hall keys (clue 2)."], "cleared": ["<b>Rev. Webb</b> and <b>Mrs Pike</b> were at evensong the whole time (clues 1 and 3).", "<b>Gemma</b>'s key was with her, and the costume doesn't fit her; <b>Tilly</b> and <b>Ken</b> only report what they found and saw (clues 2, 4 and 5)."]}}, {"slug": "the-vanishing-vinyl", "level": 2, "crime": "Theft", "who": "thief", "title": "The Vanishing Vinyl", "teaser": "A rare signed record worth £12,000 disappears from a record shop during an in-store gig. The playlist, a power cut and a guitar case hide the truth.", "intro": "At <b>Groove Records</b>, a signed first pressing of a famous 1960s album, worth £12,000, vanished from its locked display case during a busy in-store gig. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Groove Records, a signed first pressing of a famous 1960s album, worth £12,000, vanished from its locked display case during a busy in-store gig. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Della King", "role": "Shop owner"}, {"name": "Ivy Jones", "role": "Shop assistant"}, {"name": "Kofi Mensah", "role": "Sound engineer"}, {"name": "Maya King", "role": "Della's daughter, ticket desk"}, {"name": "Rich Stone", "role": "Band's guitarist"}, {"name": "Sean Cole", "role": "Collector"}], "clues": [{"name": "Della King", "role": "Shop owner", "quote": "The record was in its case at seven when the band started. During the song where all the lights went out for effect, someone opened the case. When t