0px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Dennis Kerr", "motive": "Cyril planned to sell the land and scrap the railway; Dennis said it would be 'over my dead body – or his' (clue 5).", "proof": ["Cyril was struck at 17:12, when the model clock tower fell (clue 1). The gate was locked at 17:00, so only staff were inside (clues 1 and 4).", "Dennis says he never left the shed, but the trains were stopped by hand at 17:08 and only restarted at 17:20 (clue 3).", "At 17:10 Gary saw Dennis carrying a spanner past the church, and the café camera shows a man in oily overalls going to the church at 17:10 and hurrying back to the railway shed at 17:14 (clues 4 and 6)."], "cleared": ["<b>Gary</b> left through the gate at 17:11, before Cyril was struck (clue 4).", "<b>Rita</b> was in Exeter (clue 2), <b>Pearl</b> was cashing up in her café at 17:12 (clue 6), and <b>Owen</b> watches the cameras remotely."]}}, {"slug": "the-missing-guinea-pig", "level": 1, "crime": "Theft", "who": "thief", "title": "The Missing Guinea Pig", "teaser": "The class guinea pig vanishes from the school over the weekend. Carrot crumbs, a pet carrier and a sign-in sheet help find who took Biscuit home.", "intro": "At <b>Willowbank School</b>, Biscuit the class guinea pig was missing from her cage on Monday morning. Luckily she was safe and well – but who took her, and why didn't they say? Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Willowbank School, Biscuit the class guinea pig was missing from her cage on Monday morning. Luckily she was safe and well – but who took her, and why didn't they say? Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Miss Hannah Price", "role": "Class teacher"}, {"name": "Mr Gary Ward", "role": "Pet Club leader"}, {"name": "Mr Leo Fox", "role": "Pet shop owner"}, {"name": "Mr