pawnbroker for £540 (clues 5 and 6).", "proof": ["The coins vanish between closing and opening, and you need a cabinet key (clues 1 and 2). Dora is the only key holder who takes her key home (clue 2).", "Dora says the camera shows her leaving at 19:00 and never touching the calendar. But the camera runs one hour fast: she really arrived at 18:02, opened the cabinet at 18:41 and left at 19:05 (clue 4).", "The next day she sold three star-stamped gold coins at Barker's (clues 5 and 6)."], "cleared": ["<b>Tess</b>'s key is locked in the safe overnight, and <b>Owen</b> owns the coins (clue 2).", "<b>Marcus</b> was in Edinburgh, and <b>Ben</b> and <b>Rita</b> only report what they found (clues 3, 4 and 5)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-tram-depot", "level": 3, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Tram Depot", "teaser": "A depot manager is found dead in the inspection pit on a snowy night. Tram running times, a radio log and a missing glove reveal the killer.", "intro": "At the <b>Northgate Tram Depot</b>, night manager Frank Doyle was found dead in the inspection pit under tram 14. He had been struck on the head with a heavy spanner. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Northgate Tram Depot, night manager Frank Doyle was found dead in the inspection pit under tram 14. He had been struck on the head with a heavy spanner. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-19", "suspects": [{"name": "Dev Malik", "role": "Track cleaner"}, {"name": "DS Amy Ward", "role": "Police"}, {"name": "Gary Price", "role": "Tram driver, route 3"}, {"name": "Nell Hughes", "role": "Radio controller"}, {"name": "Rosa Grant", "role": "Uniform store"}, {"name": "Tom Byrne", "role": "Tram driver, route 5"}], "clues": [{"name": "DS Amy Ward", "role": "Police", "quote": "Mr Doyle's smashed watch stopped at 23:18. A