w', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the <b>Portwell Naval Museum</b>, curator Dr Simon Lake was found dead in the torpedo room of the old submarine HMS Thresher after a late-night ghost tour. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:murder-aboard-the-museum-submarine/prof-iris-bell}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Prof. Iris Bell</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Museum trustee</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I argued with Simon about the museum budget that afternoon. But I spent the evening at the trustees' dinner across town – speech and all.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · PROF. IRIS BELL</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · IRIS'S STATEMENT</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Trustees' dinner programme</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Venue</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Harbour Hotel, across town</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">21:00–22:30</div><div 