osted by the rival Westbury Echo one hour before the Gazette went to print. Someone inside leaked it. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": null, "public": "9999-12-31", "suspects": [{"name": "Alex Fry", "role": "Night editor"}, {"name": "Ian Doyle", "role": "Sports editor"}, {"name": "Leon Ward", "role": "Photographer"}, {"name": "Moira Kerr", "role": "Editor"}, {"name": "Sid Mallon", "role": "IT manager"}, {"name": "Tess Brook", "role": "Subeditor"}], "clues": [{"name": "Moira Kerr", "role": "Editor", "quote": "Only four of us saw the story before printing. I always put a tiny different mistake in each person's copy – so I know exactly whose copy leaked.", "label": "EDITOR'S NOTE", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Editor's secret typos</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%\"><tr><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Copy for</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Hidden mistake</th></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Sports desk – Ian</td><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">'councilor' (one L)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">