 repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">ELLIE'S NOTE</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">About 21:00 – big red torch going</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">into the leaders' tent. Someone</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">tall, in a leader's green neckerchief.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Came out 5 minutes later.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Ellie</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justi