 #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Down 4F → 2F</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">M. Pike</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">23:57</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Up GF → 4F</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">C. Vane</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">23:44–23:51</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Alarm</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Stockroom door HELD OPEN (no card used)</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; line-height: 1.45\">Till receipts carry the operator's code – not the person standing at the till.</div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 242 · LEVEL 3 · MURDER</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">DEATH AT THE<br>MIDNIGHT SALE</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At <b>Harrow &amp; Vane</b>, the grand old department store, owner <b>Edmund Vane</b> planned to announce the sale of the store at the stroke of midnight on Black Friday. At 00:20 he was found dead in the fourth-floor stockroom, struck with a brass display weight. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:death-at-the-midnight-sale/jonah-reed}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Jonah Reed</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Security guard</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”The back stairs camera covers the only stairs between the second and fourth floors that skip the shop floor. I logged everyone on it.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · JONAH REED</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · STAIRWELL CAMERA</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Back stairs camera – log</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%\"><tr><th style=\"font-f