le=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Martin Pike", "motive": "Martin overheard Edmund confirm the sale of the store he had worked in for thirty years, and was furious (clue 5).", "proof": ["Edmund died between 23:40 and 23:50 (clue 1). Edmund was alive on the phone until 23:46 (clues 4 and 5).", "Martin's 23:47 till receipt seems to clear him – but receipts only show the operator's code (clue 6). The camera shows him going back up to the fourth floor at 23:47 and down again at 23:51 (clue 6).", "The stockroom needs a key card, and Martin's card shows no return – but the door alarm shows it was held open from 23:44, when Martin left, until 23:51, when he went back down (clues 3 and 6). He propped it so he could slip back in without a trace."], "cleared": ["<b>Clara</b> only reached the fourth floor at 23:57 (clues 3 and 6) – after Edmund was dead; her call at 23:49 went unanswered (clue 4).", "<b>Rachel</b> left at 23:36 while Edmund was still alive (clues 3 and 4). <b>Dr Hollis</b>, <b>Mr Ellison</b> and <b>Jonah</b> only report what they found."]}}]
